```

Best-effort. Errors swallowed because the diff already succeeded.

### `cmd/versions.go` changes

Same `ValidArgsFunction` wiring as diff. NO `Add` call — the user explicitly excluded `versions` from triggers.

### `cmd/root.go` changes

None. The `--known-modules-file` flag is on the diff and versions subcommands, not global (different flag scope = clearer cobra completion semantics).

### `internal/tui/picker.go` changes

```go
