```

In `updateLoading`, after `versionsLoadedMsg` arrives with no error and a non-empty version list, dispatch a fire-and-forget add via a tea.Cmd:

```go
return p, addKnownCmd(p.knownPath, p.moduleID)
```

Where `addKnownCmd` is:

```go
func addKnownCmd(path string, id api.ModuleIdentifier) tea.Cmd {
    return func() tea.Msg {
        _ = known.Add(path, id.Namespace+"/"+id.Name+"/"+id.Provider)
        return nil
    }
