> **For agentic workers:** REQUIRED SUB-SKILL: Use superpowers:subagent-driven-development (recommended) or superpowers:executing-plans to implement this plan task-by-task. Steps use checkbox (`- [ ]`) syntax for tracking.

**Goal:** Persist user-confirmed module addresses (`namespace/name/provider`) in a plain-text file at `os.UserConfigDir()/birdseye/known-modules`, and offer them as suggestions through cobra shell completion (CLI) and `bubbles/textinput` ghost-text (TUI picker).

